WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Skin panels lift off the fuselage and wing, exposing titanium longerons, fuel cells, and intake trunks.

00:05.000 --> 00:05.800
Belly weapons-bay doors swing open on hydraulic actuators marked 4000 psi.

00:05.800 --> 00:10.000
The camera moves under the fuselage. The doors hold open.

00:10.000 --> 00:17.000
Trapeze arms push an AIM-120 class missile out of the bay along emerald guide rails, into clear air.

00:17.000 --> 00:25.000
Flat convergent-divergent nozzles pitch 20 degrees. Shock diamonds pulse in the afterburner-blue plume.

00:25.000 --> 00:34.000
The view pulls back to the whole jet. Control surfaces, nozzle vector, and inlet bypass settle on one telemetry clock.
